---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Terms of Service - AmerisPro">
  <div class="legal-page">
    <div class="container">
      
      <!-- Hero Header -->
      <div class="legal-hero">
        <div class="badge badge-legal">📜 SaaS Master Subscription Agreement</div>
        <h1 class="legal-title">Terms of Service</h1>
        <p class="legal-subtitle">
          Please review these Terms of Service governing your access to and use of the 
          <strong>AmerisPro Safety Hub SaaS Platform</strong>.
        </p>
        <div class="legal-meta">
          <span>📅 Effective Date: July 25, 2026</span>
          <span>•</span>
          <span>⚖️ Jurisdiction: Malaysia & International</span>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="legal-content">
        
        <div class="legal-card">
          <h2>1. Acceptance of Terms & 14-Day Free Trial</h2>
          <p>
            By registering an account, logging in via Google OAuth, or accessing the AmerisPro platform ("Service"), you agree to be bound by these Terms of Service.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Automatic 14-Day Free Trial:</strong> All new workspace registrations automatically receive 14 days of full platform access with zero credit card or payment commitment.</li>
            <li><strong>Trial Feature Allowances:</strong> Free trial workspaces receive access to all core modules (Inspections, Incident Logging, PPE, Staff, Contractors) and up to <strong>25 AI OSH Legal Search queries</strong>.</li>
            <li><strong>Post-Trial Upgrade:</strong> Upon expiration of the 14-day trial, your workspace requires an upgrade to a Premium Subscription to maintain active edit access.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-card">
          <h2>2. Subscriptions, Payments & Billing</h2>
          <p>AmerisPro offers Premium Subscriptions payable in Malaysian Ringgit (MYR) or equivalent USD for international workspaces:</p>
          <ul>
            <li><strong>Payment Processing:</strong> Payments are securely processed via authorized Malaysian payment gateways (HitPay / ToyyibPay) supporting FPX Online Banking, DuitNow QR, Touch 'n Go eWallet, and major Debit/Credit Cards.</li>
            <li><strong>Instant Activation:</strong> Premium subscription upgrades activate instantly upon payment confirmation and grant <strong>100 AI OSH Legal Search credits per month</strong>.</li>
            <li><strong>Non-Refundable Policy:</strong> Paid subscription fees are non-refundable once activated, except as required under mandatory statutory consumer protection laws.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-card">
          <h2>3. Data Ownership & Intellectual Property</h2>
          <p>
            You retain 100% full ownership of all site inspection records, safety audit logs, uploaded worker photos, PPE stock inventories, and contractor registration data created in your workspace.
          </p>
          <ul>
            <li>AmerisPro claims no ownership rights over your proprietary safety data.</li>
            <li>AmerisPro retains all intellectual property rights in the software architecture, design system, AI vector search algorithms, and brand assets.</li>
          </ul>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-card">
          <h2>4. AI OSH Legal Search Disclaimer</h2>
          <p>
            The AI Legal Search feature provides automated summaries of Malaysian safety legislation (such as Act 514 OSH 1994, Act 872 Gig Workers 2025, Act 302, USECHH 2000) for informational and compliance assistance only.
          </p>
          <div class="disclaimer-box">
            ⚠️ <strong>Legal Disclaimer:</strong> AI-generated search summaries do not constitute formal legal advice. Organizations should consult certified OSH practitioners or legal experts for official court proceedings or statutory litigation.
          </div>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-card">
          <h2>5. Service Availability & SLA</h2>
          <p>
            We strive to maintain a 99.9% uptime SLA for the AmerisPro platform using multi-region Singapore cloud infrastructure. Planned maintenance will be announced in advance inside the system dashboard.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-card">
          <h2>6. Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p>
            To the maximum extent permitted under Malaysian law, AmerisPro shall not be liable for any indirect, incidental, or consequential damages arising from site safety incidents, OSH audit outcomes, or statutory enforcement actions.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div class="legal-card legal-contact-card">
          <h3>💬 Have questions about our Terms of Service?</h3>
          <p>Contact our support and legal compliance team at:</p>
          <a href="mailto:support@amerispro.com" class="legal-contact-btn">✉️ Contact Legal Team</a>
        </div>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>

<style>
  .legal-page {
    padding: 40px 16px 64px;
    background: #FFF9EC;
    min-height: 100vh;
    font-family: 'Fredoka', sans-serif;
    color: #2B2D42;
  }

  .container {
    max-width: 900px;
    margin: 0 auto;
  }

  .legal-hero {
    text-align: center;
    margin-bottom: 32px;
  }

  .badge-legal {
    display: inline-flex;
    align-items: center;
    padding: 6px 14px;
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 700;
    background: #FFD166;
    border: 3px solid #2B2D42;
    border-radius: 20px;
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 0px #2B2D42;
    margin-bottom: 16px;
  }

  .legal-title {
    font-size: 2.2rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 12px;
  }

  .legal-subtitle {
    font-size: 1.05rem;
    max-width: 720px;
    margin: 0 auto 16px;
    line-height: 1.5;
    color: #4A4E69;
  }

  .legal-meta {
    font-size: 0.85rem;
    font-weight: 600;
    color: #6C757D;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    align-items: center;
    gap: 8px;
  }

  .legal-content {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 20px;
  }

  .legal-card {
    background: #FFFFFF;
    border: 3px solid #2B2D42;
    border-radius: 16px;
    padding: 28px;
    box-shadow: 5px 5px 0px #2B2D42;
  }

  .legal-card h2 {
    font-size: 1.35rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 14px;
    color: #2B2D42;
    border-bottom: 2.5px solid #FFD166;
    padding-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .legal-card p, .legal-card li {
    font-size: 0.95rem;
    line-height: 1.6;
    color: #333333;
  }

  .legal-card ul {
    padding-left: 20px;
    margin-top: 10px;
  }

  .legal-card li {
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .disclaimer-box {
    background: #FFEED2;
    border: 2.5px solid #2B2D42;
    border-radius: 12px;
    padding: 16px;
    margin-top: 14px;
    font-size: 0.9rem;
    font-weight: 600;
  }

  .legal-contact-card {
    background: #FFEED2;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .legal-contact-card h3 {
    font-size: 1.25rem;
    font-weight: 800;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
  }

  .legal-contact-btn {
    display: inline-block;
    margin-top: 14px;
    padding: 10px 20px;
    background: #2B2D42;
    color: #FFFFFF;
    font-weight: 700;
    border-radius: 10px;
    text-decoration: none;
    border: 2.5px solid #2B2D42;
    box-shadow: 3px 3px 0px #FFD166;
    transition: transform 0.1s;
  }

  .legal-contact-btn:hover {
    transform: translate(-1px, -1px);
  }
</style>
